---
import BaseLayout from '../layouts/BaseLayout.astro';
---

<BaseLayout title="页面未找到" description="请求的知识页面不存在或已经移动。" noindex>
  <section class="not-found container">
    <span>404</span>
    <h1>这条知识路径<br />还没有被建立。</h1>
    <p>页面可能已移动、尚未发布，或地址输入有误。</p>
    <div class="button-row">
      <a class="button button-primary" href="/">返回首页</a>
      <a class="button" href="/search/">搜索知识库</a>
    </div>
  </section>
</BaseLayout>

<style>
  .not-found {
    min-height: 70vh;
    padding-top: 120px;
    text-align: center;
  }

  .not-found > span {
    color: var(--gold);
    font-family: var(--font-serif);
    font-size: 1.2rem;
    font-style: italic;
  }

  h1 {
    margin: 24px 0;
    font-family: var(--font-serif);
    font-size: clamp(3rem, 9vw, 7rem);
    font-weight: 500;
    letter-spacing: -0.07em;
    line-height: 0.98;
  }

  p {
    color: var(--ink-soft);
  }

  .button {
    margin-top: 20px;
  }

  .button-row {
    justify-content: center;
  }
</style>
